  "packProvenanceNote": "East attack reuses exact own idle opening and three newly authored free CPU source-UV ready/thrust/recovery keys,880ms one-shot. Original63 poses/31 other clips/pivots/body calibration remain exact; page extends below3584px and rooted bounds expand for the weapon.2830 exact own-seed donor pixels (2399 body,321 far upper,110 far cuff),377 original joint overlap pixels; no other-facing pixels or provider jobs. Native contact/readability pending.",
  "packReadme": "# Human Spearman preview\n\nDefault v1 pack0.12.0 preserves all63 previous poses and adds three own-East ready/thrust/recovery poses, using the exact existing idle opening. All8 source walk headings and SE/NE attacks remain; East attack plays once in880ms. Existing pivots/body calibration and31 other clips are unchanged. The complete preceding2048x3584 RGBA/mask prefix remains, with three new416x352 slots below it on a2048x3968 page. Rooted weapon bounds expand conservatively.\n\nThere are66 registered poses:32 originals,28 earlier authored walks and6 authored attack poses (NE/E). This slice adds3, reuses1 existing opening, mirrors0 and borrows0 other-facing poses. Explicit own-seed restoration:2399 body donors (including370 boot-cuff and58 boot-leather pixels),321 far upper-arm and110 far cuff donors:2830 total.377 original joint overlap pixels are separate from reconstruction. All sources, deterministic registrations and private authoring trials remain retained. No paid/provider jobs, private source or held replacement identity.\n\nSource gaps at frozen baseline c3a2fe77: Spearman12 (attack N/S/SW/W/NW; defeat N/NE/E/S/SW/W/NW), Infantry21, Archer21:54 military source cells. All63 original native/deployed cells remain unverified. The full builder replays seven public directional walk stages, NE action then East action deterministically. Last-stage repeat uses append-spearman-public-seed-action.py east.\n",
